freshmen -- such as Caleb Downs and Zachariah Branch -- have had an instant impact. For several others, we're waiting to see how their careers will turn out.","published":"2023-11-15T14:55:58.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/recruiting/story/_/id/38895893/how-top-50-2023-recruits-done-college-freshmen","type":"Story","byline":"Blake Baumgartner and Tom VanHaaren","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Five-star safety Peyton Bowen flips again, now off to Oklahoma","description":"Five-star safety prospect Peyton Bowen, who previously flipped his commitment from Notre Dame to Oregon, has flipped once again, signing with Oklahoma Sooners, he announced on Twitter on Thursday.","published":"2024-01-23T16:02:06.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/35306416/five-star-safety-peyton-bowen-flips-again-now-oklahoma","type":"HeadlineNews","byline":"Blake Baumgartner","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Five-star safety Peyton Bowen flips from Notre Dame to Oregon","description":"Five-star safety Peyton Bowen, the No. 14 overall prospect in the 2023 ESPN 300, has flipped his commitment from Notre Dame to Oregon on national signing day.","published":"2024-01-15T20:32:55.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/35298055/five-star-safety-peyton-bowen-flips-notre-dame-oregon","type":"HeadlineNews","byline":"Blake Baumgartner","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Power Rankings: Chaos shifts top 25 in Week 12","description":"UCLA and Ohio State fell, and three teams joined the list. How did the top 25 change after a wild Week 12?","published":"2026-11-23T12:14:22.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50545207/2026-college-football-power-rankings-top-25-week-12","type":"Story","byline":"ESPN","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Tennessee fined by SEC after fans throw golf balls on field","description":"Tennessee was fined $250,000 by the SEC after fans threw golf balls and mustard bottles onto the football field late during Saturday's win over LSU.","published":"2026-11-23T01:42:14.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50568028/tennessee-fined-sec-fans-throw-golf-balls-field","type":"HeadlineNews","byline":"Alex Scarborough","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Sources: Notre Dame loses safety Luke Talich to torn Achilles","description":"Notre Dame starting safety Luke Talich sustained a torn right Achilles tendon in Saturday's win against SMU, sources told ESPN.","published":"2026-11-22T23:15:45.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50566676/notre-dame-loses-safety-luke-talich-torn-achilles","type":"HeadlineNews","byline":"Pete Thamel and Adam Rittenberg","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"What Week 12's unexpected results mean for Rivalry Week and beyond","description":"After another chaotic weekend, we look at the playoff and conference races on the line with one game to go.","published":"2026-11-22T23:54:19.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50563018/week-12-results-rivalry-week","type":"Story","byline":"Bill Connelly","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"2027 recruit AJ Randle Jr. flips from Miami to Notre Dame","description":"Notre Dame coach Marcus Freeman flipped Miami pledge AJ Randle Jr., ESPN's No. 9 outside linebacker in the 2027 recruiting class, to fill a late-cycle need.","published":"2026-11-22T22:48:18.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50565158/2027-recruit-aj-randle-jr-flips-miami-notre-dame","type":"HeadlineNews","byline":"Eli Lederman","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Pac-12 reveals unique flex schedule for season's final week","description":"The Pac-12 announced its unique flex schedule for the final week of the regular season early Sunday morning.","published":"2026-11-22T21:20:00.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50564960/pac-12-reveals-unique-flex-schedule-season-final-week","type":"HeadlineNews","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Montana State ranked No. 1, 5-7 LIU makes FCS bracket as conference champ","description":"Defending national champion Montana State received the top seed for the 24-team FCS playoffs, while Northeast Conference champion LIU (5-7) became the first playoff team with a losing record since 2017.","published":"2026-11-23T00:02:39.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50564910/montana-state-grabs-top-seed-24-team-fcs-playoff-bracket","type":"HeadlineNews","source":"ESPN"}],"links":{"espn":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/player/_/id/4870625/peyton-bowen","wikipedia":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Peyton_Bowen"},"wiki":{"rules":4,"title":"Peyton Bowen","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Peyton_Bowen","description":"American football cornerback (born 2004)","touched":"2026-11-14T07:34:50Z","intro":"Peyton Bowen (born March 1, 2004) is an American college football safety for the Oklahoma Sooners.","sections":[{"key":"early","title":"Early life","text":"Bowen grew up in Denton, Texas. He attended and played high school football at John H. Guyer High School. He intercepted 12 passes and broke up 23 passes in three varsity seasons at Guyer.\n\nRECRUITMENT\nBowen was rated a five-star recruit by ESPN and initially committed Notre Dame over offers from Alabama, Oklahoma, and USC. He later flipped his commitment from Notre Dame to Oregon. However, the following day Bowen changed his commitment a second time and signed his National Letter of Intent to play at Oklahoma. He later explained that his decision was due to a paperwork issue as Oregon had not sent him a letter of intent to sign before the start of the early signing period."},{"key":"college","title":"College career","text":"Bowen joined the Oklahoma Sooners as an early enrollee in January 2023. He entered the season as the team's second-string safety."}],"family":[{"relation":"Sibling","name":"Eli Bowen","description":"American football player","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Eli_Bowen_(American_football)"}]}}